cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SuperMD, please cite it as below."
title: "SuperMD: A Universal Anti-Slop System Prompt for Any Profession"
abstract: >-
  SuperMD is an open-source, pure-Markdown system prompt that names and bans the
  measurable patterns of AI "slop" — filler language, unfounded or fabricated
  claims, and structure that stands in for substance — and pairs each ban with
  the concrete behavior that replaces it. It composes a universal core with
  per-profession domain modules across 16 categories and 93 sub-fields, ships in
  English and Bahasa Indonesia, is grounded in published research on the
  statistical signatures of machine text, and is verified by an eval harness.
type: software
